Error [jet.ValueThrownAway]: This Int value is thrown away
  --> tests/ui/ownership/builtin_mut_receiver_uses_two_phase_reservation_4.jet:4:11
    |
  4 |     clock.advance(clock.now())
    |           ^^^^^^^
 Why: `run` has no return type, so it returns nothing and the value of its last line is lost
 Fix: If `run` should return it, write `-> Int` after its parameter list; to discard it on purpose, write `.drop("reason")`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0433
